@startuml
!include style.iuml
|Respondent|
|App or browser|
|Server|
|Respondent|
start
:Fill in name, email, password,\nage, gender, governorate,\ninterests;
|App or browser|
:Send the registration\n(app);
|Server|
if (Fields valid and\nemail not registered?) then ([yes])
  :Store the account (email\nnot confirmed) and the\nprofile in one transaction;
  :Email the confirmation\nlink (valid 3 days);
else ([no])
  |App or browser|
  :Mark the fields;
  stop
endif
|App or browser|
:Show log-in with\n"Account created...";
|Respondent|
:Open the link\nin a browser;
|Server|
if (Link valid?) then ([yes])
  :Mark the email\nconfirmed;
else ([no])
  |Respondent|
  :Ask for a new link\non the resend page;
  |Server|
  :Send it to an unconfirmed\naccount, once in 5 min;
endif
|App or browser|
:Show "Email confirmed..."\nor "If an unconfirmed\naccount uses this email...";
stop
@enduml
